	The royal wave rings a standing wave pulse on every 3rd foe it pierces
	''' */
/* GsNebulaArcanum.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: hits build Arcanum; at full charge, right click to spin up the Nebula Spiral
	Three nebula arms orbit you, grinding foes and dragging the lesser ones inward
	The arcanum orb itself now swells in flight and slowly drags lesser foes toward its heart
	Nebula mist rises from the staff as the gauge fills
	''' */
/* GsNebulaBlaze.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: hits build Blaze; at full charge, right click to mark a nova on the target near your cursor
	It detonates in three staggered blast rings around a gravity well
	Nebula eruption bolts now always ignite a micro nova where they strike
	''' */
/* GsLunarFlare.Desc:
